      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Loomis%2C_Washington"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Loomis grew into a bustling silver boomtown in the 1890s, drawing miners, saloons, and dance halls to its Main Street.",
